[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2702.55, "timestamp": "00:45:02", "text": "重新装弹。那个人被扣留了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2704.15, "timestamp": "00:45:04", "text": "我们小队把他团灭了。没关系。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2714.39, "timestamp": "00:45:14", "text": "我本来可以用一个好的ROM。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2727.03, "timestamp": "00:45:27", "text": "我不知道我怎么会变成那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2730.39, "timestamp": "00:45:30", "text": "舵。我很想拥有一副舵，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2732.47, "timestamp": "00:45:32", "text": "它很贵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2735.349, "timestamp": "00:45:35", "text": "呃，他们就像……我觉得这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2737.51, "timestamp": "00:45:37", "text": "他们设置了一个怜悯机制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2741.27, "timestamp": "00:45:41", "text": "现在。所以，就好像每500次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2745.67, "timestamp": "00:45:45", "text": "包。 500太多了。 500 是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2747.109, "timestamp": "00:45:47", "text": "很多。是的。但如果你足够喜欢玩的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2748.79, "timestamp": "00:45:48", "text": "如果你真的很想要一个，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2750.39, "timestamp": "00:45:50", "text": "保证有人能免费玩。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2753.19, "timestamp": "00:45:53", "text": "就是要花很长时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2755.03, "timestamp": "00:45:55", "text": "但这算数。这也算数，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2756.87, "timestamp": "00:45:56", "text": "活动礼包也包含在内。他们统计了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2759.43, "timestamp": "00:45:59", "text": "500。"}]